// Complete classic ESP32 source profile, matching the source graph used by
// the Atom voice firmware, without its application, credentials or board API.
// This is source composition, NOT a boot entry or linked SDK archive. Compile
// with the application as one LLVM unit; unused implementations can be pruned.
// Caller still supplies startup/linker layout and required architecture symbol
// bindings. Prefer focused backend imports when their full dependencies suffice.
